From c959763209ee4ad2abee09c2c6c513ed99a91be5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matt C <latentcollapse@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 01:55:01 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 37/42] neurajl: the workspace map opens the session's first
 result and the first after each compaction

The kernel (lab d469d29) builds the map on request. The compaction note
says it is coming. Option workspaceMap (or NEURAJL_WORKSPACE_MAP=0) turns it
off; tests that assert a first call's exact output opt out.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../coding-agent/src/core/tools/neurajl.ts    | 21 ++++++++--
 .../suite/neurajl-substrate-modes.test.ts     | 42 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 59 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

